# MotorPH database setup scripts

Run these files in MySQL Workbench in this exact order:

1. 01_schema.sql
2. 02_reference_data.sql
3. 03_employee_seed.sql
4. 04_user_account_seed.sql
5. 05_views.sql
6. 06_test_data.sql

Runtime rule:
UI -> Service -> DAO -> MySQL

Do not run BulkAccountGenerator during normal application runtime.
BulkAccountGenerator should only be used as a development/admin utility.

